  "generated_text": "To compute \\(\\dbinom{50}{2}\\), we use the formula for combinations:\n\n\\[\n\\dbinom{n}{k} = \\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}\n\\]\n\nHere, \\(n = 50\\) and \\(k = 2\\). Plugging in these values, we get:\n\n\\[\n\\dbinom{50}{2} = \\frac{50!}{2!(50-2)!} = \\frac{50!}{2! \\cdot 48!}\n\\]\n\nWe can simplify this by canceling out the \\(48!\\) in the numerator and the denominator:\n\n\\[\n\\dbinom{50}{2} = \\frac{50 \\times 49 \\times 48!}{2 \\times 48!} = \\frac{50 \\times 49}{2}\n\\]\n\nNow, perform the multiplication and division:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{2450}{2} = 1225\n\\]\n\nThus, the final answer is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1225}\n\\]",
